  "notes": [
    "Replaying the attacker's initialize call succeeds from the April 2025 upgrade onward and reverts before it; the latest upgrade before the exploit is the reset. No OwnershipTransferred from initialize appears between that upgrade and the exploit, so no earlier caller.",
    "The attacker returned 90% after Renegade's onchain bounty offer; per rule 5 this does not make it a rescue, and returns are not subtracted.",
    "SYNTH, DeFAI, FTW, EVA, HOL, BKC and SNL are listed unvalued: no reliable price, never sold by the attacker; their market value is negligible."
